B.O1=new A.y("Harvest Feast","The village celebrates the harvest. All eat and laugh together.","Be thankful for the crop and share the joy with neighbors.",B.q)
B.N_=new A.y("Farewell Greeting","Kiko says goodbye. Kiss the grandparents' hands before leaving.","Say a polite goodbye \u2014 a sign of love and respect.",B.Q)
