B.LX=new A.y("Distant Star","The star we see is really light from long ago.","What you do today can have an effect for a long time.",B.K)
B.NR=new A.y("Warm Sun","The sun gives light and energy to the whole Earth.","Bring good to many people, like the sun.",B.q)
